// Granted by Heroes/Kai's CompressionSkillAction (rank 2+) onto the owner, then baked as a copy of
// itself directly onto the spawned Vortex entity by SpawnVortexEffectData - scales VortexDamageUpgrade's
// AreaDamage, VortexImplosionUpgrade's own pulses and VortexExplodeOnDestroy's final blast all off the
// same live count of enemies currently caught (Vortex.CaughtCount, refreshed once per pull pulse) -
// see VortexSystem.ResolveCrowdMultiplier. MaxCount clamps how many enemies contribute, so a big pull
// radius against a large swarm can't blow damage numbers up unboundedly.
component VortexCrowdDamageUpgrade
{
    FP PerEnemyBonus;
    Int32 MaxCount;
}
